                "reason": "等待 exp_053 PID 123495 退出（已到210K步，可能在做最终eval/checkpoint）",
                "prompt": "等待 exp_053 PegInsertion frozen s0 完成并提取最终指标。\n\n## bjb1-45299 — exp_053 (PID 123495, cuda:1)\n上次还差 ~13K 步（约 207K/210K），几分钟内应该完成。DreamerV3 overshoot 到 ~222K。\n\n### 步骤 1: 在服务器端阻塞等待进程退出\n```bash\nwhile ps -p 123495 > /dev/null 2>&1; do sleep 30; done\necho \"PROCESS 123495 EXITED\"\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 进程退出后，提取完整最终指标\n```bash\ncd /root/autodl-tmp/event-gated-adaptive-horizon\npython3 -c \"\nimport json, os\nlogdir = 'logdir/exp_053_peginsertion_frozen_s0'\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk(logdir):\n    for f in files:\n        if f == 'metrics.jsonl':\n            path = os.path.join(root, f)\n            with open(path) as fh:\n                lines = fh.readlines()\n            print(f'Total eval lines:')\n            last_ve = None\n            last_ve_step = None\n            last_ret = None\n            last_ret_step = None\n            for line in lines:\n                d = json.loads(line)\n                step = d.get('step', 0)\n                ve = None\n                for k in ['civo/ve_ratio', 've_ratio']:\n                    if k in d:\n                        ve = d[k]\n                        break\n                ret = None\n                for k in ['eval/return', 'episode/return']:\n                    if k in d:\n                        ret = d[k]\n                        break\n                if ve is not None or ret is not None:\n                    print(f'step={step}, ve_ratio={ve}, eval_return={ret}')\n                    if ve is not None:\n                        last_ve = ve\n                        last_ve_step = step\n                    if ret is not None:\n                        last_ret = ret\n                        last_ret_step = step\n            last = json.loads(lines[-1])\n            print(f'---')\n            print(f'FINAL_STEP={last.get(\"step\",\"?\")}')\n            print(f'EVAL_FINAL={last_ret}@{last_ret_step}')\n            print(f'VE_RATIO_FINAL={last_ve}@{last_ve_step}')\n            break\n\"\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 检查 checkpoint 文件\n```bash\nls -la logdir/exp_053_peginsertion_frozen_s0/checkpoint*.ckpt 2>/dev/null || ls -la logdir/exp_053_peginsertion_frozen_s0/checkpoint/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO CHECKPOINT FOUND\"\n```\n\n## 输出格式\n```\n=== exp_053 PegInsertion frozen s0 — COMPLETED ===\n最终步数: XXXK\neval_final: XX.XX @step\nve_ratio_final: X.XX @step\ncheckpoint: [路径]\n完整 ve_ratio 趋势 (所有 eval 点)\n```"
